# Compression Layer side-channel (v2.14 Fase 2, PATTERN §20.10 + R.G6)
# Knowledge graph estratto da graphify-sync — view derivata, mai authoritative
# (filesystem = single source of truth, R.G1). Rebuildable da <code_path>.
.graphify-state/

# Visual oracle PNG artifacts (side-channel, not versioned)
code_quality/reports/*-visual-iter-*/
# Factory runners (generated by visual-oracle-protocol, not versioned)
.factory-runners/

# EP-007 a11y capability reports (v2.18)
code_quality/reports/*-a11y-iter-*/
code_quality/reports/_adhoc/a11y-*/

# EP-008 UX/UI capability reports + screenshots (v2.18)
# NB: <TSK>-uxui-design.{json,md} (single-pass, no iter) NON è gitignorato:
# deliverable tracciato, source of truth unico per TSK (versioning via git, ADR-020 §Rationale 8)
code_quality/reports/*-uxui-review-iter-*/
code_quality/reports/*-uxui-design-iter-*/
code_quality/reports/_adhoc/uxui-review-*/
code_quality/reports/_adhoc/uxui-design-*/

# EP-018 — FE Functional Oracle: fixture binarie (ROM/GBA/bin/iso) e trace Playwright
# Le fixture binarie sono escluse per dimensione; decommentare e adattare al proprio progetto:
# test-fixtures/*.rom
# test-fixtures/*.gba
# test-fixtures/*.bin
# **/test-fixtures/*.iso
# Trace Playwright functional oracle (EP-018)
code_quality/reports/*-functional-iter-*/trace/

# EP-009 — analytics event store (dati operativi, commit selettivo opt-in — vedi ADR-021)
analytics/events/
# EP-009 — actors map opzionale (actor_id→role, PII; gitignored opt-in se la factory
# non vuole committare la mappa actor→role — vedi ADR-023 §D). Decommenta per attivare.
# analytics/actors.yaml
# NB: NON gitignorare analytics/pricing.yaml, analytics/rates.yaml,
# analytics/reports/estimates/, analytics/reports/accuracy/ — versionati (ADR-022 §A, ADR-027 §A).

# EP-010 — stime (versionati, audit trail) e accuracy (versionati). _adhoc opzionalmente escluso.
# Le stime sono documenti immutabili rilevanti per audit (ADR-027 §A, rationale 4-5): NON
# gitignorate di default — divergenza ragionata vs analytics/events/ (dati operativi). Opt-out
# esplicito solo se la factory ha NDA cliente sulle stime (ADR-027 §A).
#   analytics/reports/estimates/   ← versionato (NON decommentare salvo NDA)
#   analytics/reports/accuracy/    ← versionato (NON decommentare salvo NDA)
# Report di stima effimeri (ad-hoc, non audit trail): opt-in escludibili. Decommenta se non
# vuoi versionare le stime esplorative in analytics/reports/_adhoc/.
# analytics/reports/_adhoc/estimate-*

# management/state/ — State file Temporal State Machine (EP-011 US-047)
# Versionati di default per audit retrospettivo (ADR-028 §A §Rationale 3).
# Per opt-out (NDA cliente o policy data residency), decommentare:
# management/state/

# EP-042 — LanceDB index (Hybrid Wiki Search, rebuilable via /wiki-search reindex)
.wiki-search/

# EP-054 — ctags symbol index side-channel (L1 Symbol Resolver, rebuilable via ctags-index.sh)
.ctags-state/

# EP-054 — LanceDB code chunk index (L2 Semantic Code Search, rebuilable via index-code.py)
.code-search/

# EP-060 Fleet Health snapshot + reports (gitignored, rebuildable)
.fleet-health/

# voice wake word samples (file WAV registrati localmente, non versionati)
voice/wake_word_samples/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Python build artifacts (tool analytics)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Env file con credenziali locali (non versionare)
.env
soli_multi_agents_factory.egg-info/
.obsidian/
.claude/worktrees/
